1. Executive SummaryGastoTrack is a high-performance mobile application designed to eliminate the "where did my money go?" mystery. By leveraging real-time synchronization through Convex and a sleek Flutter interface, it allows individuals and groups to track expenses, manage shared budgets, and visualize financial health through interactive analytics.The ProblemTraditional finance apps are often too manual for personal use and too clunky for group expense splitting.The SolutionA reactive, cross-platform app that provides instant updates for group members and deep insights for personal budgeting, monetized via a tiered subscription model.2. User PersonasThe Solo Budgeter: Wants to categorize every coffee and rent payment to hit savings goals.The Housemate/Traveler: Needs to split group dinners and utility bills without the "I'll pay you back later" awkwardness.The Power User: Requires detailed graphs and CSV exports for tax or professional tracking.3. Functional Requirements3.1 Core Personal FinanceQuick Add: One-tap entry for expenses with amount, category, and date.Categorization: Custom and preset categories (e.g., Food, Transport, Rent).Recurring Expenses: Automatic logging for monthly subscriptions or bills.3.2 Group Management (Powered by Convex)Shared Spaces: Create "Wallets" for groups (trips, households).Real-time Sync: Every member sees updates instantly as they happen.Debt Settlement: Automatic calculation of who owes whom based on split logic (Equal, Percentage, or Specific Amount).3.3 Analytics & InsightsSpending Breakdown: Visual pie charts showing category-wise spending.Historical Trends: Bar charts comparing monthly or weekly spending habits.Budget Alerts: Notifications when a user reaches 80% or 100% of a set category budget.4. Technical Stack & ArchitectureLayerTechnologyKey BenefitFrontendFlutterSingle codebase for iOS and Android with high-fidelity UI.BackendConvexReal-time reactive database; replaces traditional REST/WebSockets.PaymentsRevenueCatRobust subscription management and server-side receipt validation.AuthClerk/Convex AuthSeamless social and email-based authentication.Convex Data Schema (Conceptual)Convex allows us to define our schema in TypeScript for end-to-end type safety.users: ID, email, subscriptionStatus.expenses: amount, category, userId, groupId (optional), timestamp.groups: name, members (Array of userIds), totalBalance.5. Monetization Strategy (RevenueCat)We will implement a Freemium model.FeatureFree TierGastoTrack ProMonthly ExpensesUp to 50 entriesUnlimitedShared Groups1 Group (max 3 members)Unlimited Groups & MembersAnalyticsBasic Monthly ViewAdvanced Trends & CSV ExportsCloud SyncStandardPriority Real-time SyncRevenueCat Flow:Paywall: Use RevenueCatUI (Customer Center) for a native-feeling subscription screen.Entitlements: The app checks the premium entitlement before unlocking Group features or Advanced Analytics.6. Non-Functional RequirementsOffline Support: Users should be able to log expenses offline; Convex will sync once a connection is restored.Security: Data must be encrypted in transit. Convex provides transactional guarantees to prevent double-logging of expenses.Performance: App launch to "Ready to Type" should be under 1.5 seconds.7. Roadmap & Success MetricsPhase 1: MVP (Month 1-3)Basic Flutter UI with "Quick Add."Convex backend integration for personal tracking.RevenueCat integration for basic Pro sub.Phase 2: Collaboration (Month 4-5)Group wallet creation.Split-bill logic.Push notifications for group updates.Success MetricsDaily Active Users (DAU): Target 1,000+ within 3 months.Retention: 40% retention after Day 30.Conversion: 5% conversion rate from Free to Pro tier.